    english: Vibration
  - label: "Harita Se\xE7im Ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    turkish: "HAR\u0130TA SE\xC7"
    english: SELECT MAP
  - label: "Nas\u0131l Oynan\u0131r Ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    turkish: NASIL OYNANIR
    english: HOW TO PLAY
  - label: "Nas\u0131l Oynan\u0131r A\xE7\u0131klamas\u0131"
    turkish: "\u2022 Ara\xE7 otomatik olarak ileri gider. \u2022 Ekran\u0131n sol
      yar\u0131s\u0131na dokun: sola d\xF6n. \u2022 Ekran\u0131n sa\u011F yar\u0131s\u0131na
      dokun: sa\u011Fa d\xF6n. \u2022 Bilgisayarda A/D veya ok tu\u015Flar\u0131yla
      da d\xF6nebilirsin. \u2022 Seviye atlad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda \xE7\u0131kan
      kartlardan birini se\xE7,   arac\u0131na yeni bir yetenek kazand\u0131r  (Kalkan,
      \u015Eok Dalgas\u0131, H\u0131zlanma vb.)"
    english: "\u2022 Your car moves forward automatically. \u2022 Tap the left half
      of the screen: turn left. \u2022 Tap the right half of the screen: turn right.
      \u2022 On PC, you can also turn using A/D or the arrow keys. \u2022 When you
      level up, pick one of the cards   to grant your car a new ability  (Shield,
      Shockwave, Speed Boost, etc.)"
  - label: "Y\xFCksek Skor Etiketi"
    turkish: "En Y\xFCksek Skor:"
    english: 'High Score:'
  - label: Skor Etiketi
    turkish: 'Skor:'
